 Coldplay the Grammy for Song of the Year in 2009?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"''Clocks''","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"''Fix You''","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"''Viva la Vida''","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"''Paradise''","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"''Viva la Vida'' won Song of the Year; ''Clocks'' had taken Record of the Year in 2004."},{"id":"q7","question":"Which South Korean group collaborated with Coldplay on ''My Universe'' (2021)?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Blackpink","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"BTS","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"EXO","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"BigBang","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"''My Universe'', from Music of the Spheres, debuted at No. 1 on the Billboard Hot 100."},{"id":"q8","question":"In which year did Coldplay headline the Super Bowl halftime show?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2012","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"2014","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"2016","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"2020","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"They headlined Super Bowl 50 in February 2016, joined by Beyoncé and Bruno Mars."}]'::jsonb,
